<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Bhɔɔba nyɛ nakwyal bot ɛ ghaada Tesalonik ɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Bhɔɔba nyɛ nakwyal bot ɛ ghaada</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonik ɛ</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="imt2">Mɛsɔ mɛ mɛkana mak nakwyalaa ɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mɛ bɔɔba Pɔl nakwyal ɛ, baalii ɛ́ dum nɛ sa Pɔl nazelii tɔ mɛkana mɛ yii mɛkɛn ɛ. Dáa mɛlu di edhaŋ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ dáa ekeletyɛ di nɛ lyem pɛ ɛko nɛ dáa, Ghɛŋ Yezu dinaa ààbula.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɔ ghaada Tesalonik, bɛdhiiti ke ɛ́ náá, ɛlu ɛ Ghɛŋ eezekum (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:2">2.2</ref></char>). Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ́ ɛpebyen ɛsa mɛsa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:6-12">3.6-12</ref></char>). Bɛ ɛpeke náá, yɛ ààkaval dhiiti sonok etɛɛ náá, Ghɛŋ moo aazyɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔ mɛkana mak, Pɔl ɛpepɔɔd mɛlyo mɛ. Ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb yii ekeletyɛ ààwaaz etɛp ee bot di eboma nɛ yɛ ɛ, ààbadus-dusak elyel-lyel etɛp ee bot di eboma nɛ yɛ ɛ, ààdus pe mezuk. É ɛlu ɛ Yezu aazyɛ ɛ, ɛbiyo aanàkabadi tak (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:5-9">1.5-9</ref></char>). Nenak yak, ɛbiyo ɛpesael kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs dhatyee sɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:2-12">1.2-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak ɛpedul mɛlɔ nɛ ekeletyɛ náá, sa bɛ ààleebee náá, bi eezekum é ɛlu ɛ Yezu aazyɛ ɛ. Ɛgwaal ɛ lɔɔ ààgoka nɛ ɛlu ɛ bɛ náá, bɛ di ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ ɛsa mɛsa mɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛtsek mɛ mɛkana mak ɛ́ dáak:</para>
  <para style="io1">Mɛswosel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">ɛbula ɛ Klisto ɛ́ waasa náá, esonok djas bula é ze (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1.3-12</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">Ghɛŋ Yezu dinaa ààpabula (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-12">2.1-12</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">ɛpyet tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:13-17">2.13-17</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">mendjaala nɛ mɛsa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3.1-15</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">mɛswosel mɛ mɛsik (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3.16-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam Pɔl, nɛ Silas zɛnɔɔ Timote. Bis kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ, étɛp bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Tesalonik, bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto ɔ.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto sa bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ ɛdjɛ bin egwyem!<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waazyɛ étɛp ɛzɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, bis goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb mɛlu djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bis sesa yɛ, etɛɛ náá, bis ɛpebee ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb ɛpetɔ́ sok, dɔɔ nɛ kwyɛl bi di nɛ yɛ pak'en ɛ, ɛpebyet mɛlu djas. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bis di elii tɛp'en nɛ mɛbun djas tɔ ezɛɛga mendjaala, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛpesa zii tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb, ye nakoozodi mɛtiiga nɛ mezuk mɛ bi di eboma nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Tin, mezuk menek ɛpelyaal náá, Zɛɛb nɛ pɛ́ɛ bot tɔ epiki. Mezuk menek ɛ́ waasa náá, bi di bot ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb bi di ezuk étɛp tak ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ piki, nyɛ waabulal mezuk nɛ bot ɛ di ezuk bin ɔ, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />nɛ ɛdjɛ mɛwala nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ di ezuk ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bisɔ pe. Tin, etɛp binek aasael ɛ é sok Ghɛŋ Yezu aatuula pɛ tɔ gwoo nɛ efofop bɛ e mɛbwala ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Tin, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waatuula tɔ boo ngel du, étɛp ɛzɛwa bot ɛ di ebyen ɛgu ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ bot di ààlooba nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu ɔ é feŋ. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Tin, feŋ yɔbɔ aadi ɛ́, na kɔm-kɔm ɛlyelɛpe, étɛp bɛ needi ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ Ghɛŋ, ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ mɛbwala mɛ duma yɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Etɛp binek aasael ɛ́ dwoo Ghɛŋ aazyɛ ɛ. Bot ɛ edɛɛ djas ɛ́ waaduwal nyɛ, bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ waamyaala nɛ nɛ. Deenek, bi aadi ɛ́ tɔ lɔɔg bot ɛ tak, etɛɛ náá, bi naadum koŋ nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal bis nagoola bin ɛ.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ, bis di ààkat ɛdjaala Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. Bis ɛpedjaala nɛ Zɛɛb'es náá, nyɛ sa náá, bi kɛ dáa nyɛ nadjóo bin náá, bi kɛ ɛ. Tin, bis ɛpewaab náá, nɛ ghwyil mɛbwala mɛ, nyɛ kwyee bin étɛp bi neesa enɛm esa ee bi di ekwos ɛsa ɛ, nyɛ sa náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb nyen tɔ mɛsa men djas bi di esa ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Deenek, din ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu ɛ́ waabela duu kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, nyɛy pe ɛ́ waadjɛ bin duu. Yenek djas ɛ́ ɛkɛɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Zɛɛb'es nɛ yii Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Sa aasael ɛsok nɛ Ghɛŋ nɛ ɛkum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto moo aabula, tin, bot aadi ɛ́ sama nɛ nɛ. É di'enek, sa mɛ di ewaab nɛ nen náá: <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />Nàbetka mot zɛzɛm bin elo, nɛghu ɛbɛɛg ɛ bin náá, ɛlu ɛ ɛzyɛ ɛ Ghɛŋ eezekum. Sa mot ààmyaal nyɛ, ye nakoozodi náá, mot lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ dus pɛ daa Zɛɛb nɛghu pɛ daa les ɔɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Sa bi ààbet náá, mot kɔɔ bin nɛ dhiiti mbi mɛkɔŋ. Etɛɛ náá, ɛlu ɛ tak aanàtuula ɛsok nɛ ɛwala ɛ bot ààbyen Zɛɛb ɛ, kum, yɛ aanàkwaatuula ɛsok nɛ Mbee mot, mot nawaaa é feŋ ɔ, kum. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy aapabyen esonok ee bot di eduwal, nɛ ɛbee náá, yɛ ɛ́ dɛɛ ɛ. Tin, nyɛ waake náá, nyɛ eedhaa esonok djas nɛ mɛbɔk, nyɛ aabatakɛni tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa Zɛɛb étɛp ɛkɛdisi, é di'enek, nyɛ aasa tyee náá, nyɛy ɛ́ di Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Bi eedjisa, é sok mɛ nadi pɛ daa len ɛ, mɛ naabɛ ɛ́ aalɛɛ bin etɛp binek? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Nenak yak bi nɛ gu sa di ela mbee mot'enɔk ze náá, nyɛ nàzyɛ ɛ. Nyɛ aazotuula ɛ́, é ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb nazekoobal ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Tin, ghwyil mɛbwala mɛ Mbee mot'enɔk di esael tɔ sɔ ɛ, yɛ ɛpesa mɛsa mɛ. É ghɛŋ sa di emɛt nyɛ aakadi ààbɛ tak ɛ, nyɛ aakasa embee mɛsa mɛ ɛ́ popoopwon. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Deenek, Mot di ààlooba nɛ etsi ɔ, nyɛ waanyen, da Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ́ gó nyɛ nɛ mengwyil mɛ nuub'ɛ, nyɛ waasaab nyɛ nɛ mɛkas mɛ ɛtuula ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Mot yenɔk aatuula ɛ́ nɛ mɛbwala mɛ Satan. Nyɛ waasa bɛtɛ nɛ membi mɛ endem mɛbwala nɛ esa e ɛdjoka, yii etsal. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Nyɛ waasa membi mɛ esa djas di biyo ɛ, étɛp ɛkɔɔ bot ɛ di ewo ze ɔ. Tin, bɛ waagwyɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààmyaal ɛkwyɛl etsɛɛtsɛ ee nawaatsik bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ Zɛɛb di edhis bɛ ghwyil ɛwo, étɛp bɛ neemyaal etɛp e mɛkɔŋ. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Deenek, bot djas di ààdum koŋ nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ e Zɛɛb ɔ, da bɛ ɛ́ di emyaala tɔ ɛsa ɛbiyo ɔ, bɛ waadjɛaa epɛ́ɛ e ndjɛ sɔs.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛb naasɛ́ɛ bin étɛp bi neebela tsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, yɛ kabɛ bisɔ ɔɔ, bis goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb mɛlu djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, biyɔ bot ɛ Ghɛŋ di ekwyɛl ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nasɛ́ɛ bin bot ɛ mɛkɛn, étɛp bi neebela tsik kɔ ɛsu ɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. Sisim tak ɛ́ di esa náá, bi di nɛ tsik na dɛɛ, dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ e Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Yɛ ɛ́ etɛp tak ɛ Zɛɛb nadjóo bin, é ze Mbɛɛ Bhaadal bis nagoola bin ɛ. Tin, nyɛ nakwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bi bela di tɔ duma Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Deenek, bɔn-nyɛɛg, pyetka, baalka mɛlyo mɛ bis nalyo bin nɛ mɛkpa mɛ enuub bis ɛ, nɛ yii bis nakwyal-kwyalak ɛ.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Betka náá, Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto nyɛy ɛmet bɛ nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka mot nakwyɛl mena ɔ, nyɛy mot nadjɛ mena mɛghaaz mɛ na kɔm-kɔm nɛ tɛtɛ ɛbwaalel tɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ɔ, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />nyɛ lwoodal ebhum elyem bin nɛ mɛghaaz, nyɛ djɛ bin ghwyil ɛsa esa e mɛnyɔ tɔ mɛfulu men, nɛ tɔ mɛkpa mɛ bi di elóo ɛ.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Djaalaka étɛp'es</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Deenek, bɔn-nyɛɛg, djaalaka étɛp'es, etɛɛ náá, mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ needjala kaab kɔ mɛl, ye neebela duu, dáa yii nadhaa pɛ daa len ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Tin, baadjaalaka Zɛɛb étɛp nyɛ neepɛk bis é mɛmbɔ mɛ bɛmbee ɛ bot, bot ɛ ɛbiyo. Etɛɛ náá, ye tok bot djas di edum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Tin, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ sosoob. Nyɛ waadjɛ bin ghwyil, nyɛ waabaal bin sok bhwoob Mbee mot. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Bis ɛpemyaal nɛ lyem wat é mis mɛ Ghɛŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len náá, bi ɛpesa sa bis nalɛɛ bin ɛ, deenek, bi ɛ́ waatetɔ́ nɛ ɛsa yɛ.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Beta náá, Ghɛŋ djɛɛd ebhum elyem bin tɔ kwyɛl ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tɔ ɛmaad ɛ lyem dáa Klisto.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sa mɛsa dáa Pɔl mot-lwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, bis ɛpewaab nɛ nen nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto náá, bi di ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ bɛtsak-bel ɛ ekeletyɛ, bot ɛ́ di ààkɛ tɔ mɛlyo mɛ bis nagoola bin ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Bi nɛ gu biyɔ bɛmet dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛdu mɛfulu mes ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi bɛtsak-bel ɛ bot é ghɛŋ bis nadi pɛ yebɔ ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààwaab mot sa dek. Deenek, bis nadi ezuk tɔ ɛsa mɛsa mwos nɛ pum, ye nakoozodi náá mɛnyel eezetsak bis, ekaab náá, bis ɛzɛkɛdi ɛbɛp étɛp'en. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Ye tok náá, bis nasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààgoka nɛ ɛbela ɛkɛɛ ɛ len. Tin, bis nasa deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bis needi ndem bi di egoka nɛ ɛbaŋa ɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Deenek, é ghɛŋ bis nadi pɛ daa len ɛ, bis naalɛɛ bin náá: «Mot di ààkwyɛl ɛsa mɛsa ɔ, nyɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛdɛ edee.»<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />É di'enek, bis ɛpegwak náá, bɛdhiiti bot pak'en moo ɛ́ bɛtsak-bel, bɛ ààkwyɛl ɛsa mɛsa, tin mɛsa mɔɔ ɛ́ ɛwa nuub tɔ etɛp bɛsɔ bɔɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Nɛ mbi bot binɔk, bis ɛpedul bɛ mɛlɔ, bis ɛpelɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto náá, bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa mɛsa mɛlu djas, étɛp bɛ neebela sa dek.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ bɔn-nyɛɛg ɔɔ, nàkatka ɛsesa enɛm esa. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mot ààpalooba nɛ mɛtiŋ mɛ bis di ekwyal tɔ mɛkana mak ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi lyaal nyɛ nɛ bot djas. É di'enek, sa bi ààbaadi sama nɛ nɛ, étɛp nyɛ neebela sen. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Tin, sa bi àànɔɔ nyɛ dáa mot mɛbhuka men, djɛka nyɛ mɛlyo dáa mɔn-nyɛɛg'en.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esɛɛa mɛtel nɛ Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Beta náá Ghɛŋ, mot di ɛsuk ɛ egwyem ɔ, nyɛ ɛmet gheedjedjɛ bin egwyem é mɛwala djas. Beta náá, Ghɛŋ di sama nɛ biyɔ djas.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam, mɛ ɛmet ɛ kwyal mɛkpa mɛ mɛswosel mak nɛ mbɔ'am met. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́, mɛ dyeebaduu djin tɔ bɛmɛkana mam. Yak ɛ́ ekwyala bam. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto di nɛ biyɔ djas.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>